      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/L'Anse%2C_Michigan",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "L'Anse Township was established May 8 1846, then part of Houghton County before becoming part of Baraga County.",
